    "title": "Why Trump's Epstein Problem Won't Go Away - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago In a few weeks President Donald Trump may find out the fate of the rest of his presidency. That may sound dramatic, but allow me to explain. Next month, after the Thanksgiving recess, Congress is expected to vote to release the so-called Epstein files—the Justice Department’s witness interviews, emails, and other documents related to the investigation into the late billionaire and convicted sex offender, Jeffrey Epstein. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
